Jaffer Asws. Yateem Hogaye Baqir Asws. Guzar Gaye.<br>
<br>
bewaou'n Aur Yateemo'n Ko Be Aas Kar Gaye.<br>
<br>
1. Karbobala Mein Aapki Aankho Ke Saamne.<br>
moula Sabhi Quraan Ke Paare Bikhar Gaye.<br>
<br>
2. Kaanto'n Pe Nange Paoun Chalate Rahe Adoo L.a.<br>
moula Is Haal Mein Kayi'n Meelo'n Guzar Gaye.<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Hazrat Ko Zeher Zeen Mein Hushhaam L.a. Ne Diya.<br>
jiske Asar Se Paanchve Sarkar Margaye.<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Baandha Tha Ek Rassi Mein Bete Ko Baap Ko.<br>
baqir Asws. Bhi Saath Saath The Abid Asws. Jidhar Gaye.<br>
<br>
5. Taboot Uth Raha Hai Jo Hyder Asws. Ke Laal Ka.<br>
zehra S.a. Ne Kaha Ghar Mera Veeran Kar Gaye.<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Dafnaya Baap Bete Ne Binte Hussain Asws. Ko.<br>
manzar Wo Bhool Paaye Na Moula Guzar Gaye.<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Hargiz Kabhi Na Kam Ho Azadari E Hussain Asws.<br>
moula Yeh Baat Bete Ko Talqeen Kar Gaye.<br>
<br>
8. Mirza Kumail Aapke Gham Mein Hain Sogwaar.<br>
kitne Masayeb Aap Pe Moula Guzar Gaye.